    15	ML-DSA-65 (VERIFIER, end to end, no adaptation beyond wrapping):
    16	  key  = public_key(publicKeyDer, 'kms', HYBRID_ALG)            (Wycheproof supplies the exact RFC 9881 SPKI)
    17	  sig  = parse_signature(sig, HYBRID_ALG, 'kms', registered_codecs(HYBRID_ALG)); sig_policy(sig)
    18	  ok   = signature_verifies(msg, sig, key)                       (the verifier's document F is Wycheproof's msg)
