    21	
    22	ECDSA P-256 (VERIFIER for keys, signature codec, policy and the verification call, with ONE substitution):
    23	  key  = public_key(04 || ts || GPG_PREFIX || uncompressed, 'gpg')      (the V1 gpg-slot key form)
