    10	Policy (A9.6; service/issuer/DESIGN.md IS-03, IS-09; V1-OPERATIONS-RUNBOOK §3), every check before signing:
    11	  - the frame decodes under the service verifier's codec as tessera-v1/attest or tessera-v1/manifest, within schema;
