    13	  - attest: signer.key_fp is this key's gpg-sha256 fingerprint; manifest: sset[0] is;
    14	  - attest: |declared_issue_time - signer clock| <= EPS (24 h, A9.2);
    15	  - immediately before the HSM call: the clock is not past the configured signing stop, nor past the request's sign_by.
