   709	## 8. The gate — this project does not begin until these are true
   710	
   711	A pre-registration is only honest if it can name the condition under which the
   712	project *does not proceed*. Tessera has one, and it is non-negotiable:
   713	
   714	**Band 0 (H0) must be resolved before Phase 1 begins.** Concretely:
   715	- a machine-checked formal model (TLA+ and/or Lean4) of the attestation
   716	  construction and its claimed invariants exists, and the proof — resting on
   717	  cited external hardness assumptions, proving *our own composition* — holds;
   718	- the agreement gate has passed (author and AI each independently judge the
   719	  model faithful to the claim);
   720	- the informal written proof (the author's defend-it-cold account) is in the
   721	  repository.
   722	
   723	The gate is **machine-checked**, by design. Independent *human* formal-methods
   724	review is *not* a resolution requirement under the no-spend constraint (H3) — it
   725	is an optional enhancement gated on a revenue stream, and its absence is a
   726	declared residual risk (no review, machine or human, guarantees a future party
   727	won't find a hole). This keeps the bar rigorous *and* achievable in our control,
   728	rather than set where it can never be met.
   729	
   730	Only then does **Phase 1a** begin (implementing the cloud-independent crypto
   731	core), marked by an explicit, dated, signed commit declaring the build runway
   732	open. The 7-day H1b window opens later, at the H1a freeze commit (§2).
   733	
   734	**If H0 cannot be met, the project does not proceed as designed — and that is a
   735	valid, honest outcome of this pre-registration, not a failure to conceal.** A
   736	highlight reel cannot say "we stopped because the foundation did not hold." A
   737	real pre-registration can, and that is precisely where its credibility comes
   738	from. The central guarantee of an attestation service is not something to
   739	assert and build around; it is something to prove, or to honestly report we
   740	could not. Building on an unproven foundation would be theater — the one
   741	outcome this project exists to refute.
   400	  way, the owner records the branch taken, dated, in ENCODING-V1 §5.2 and the profile before the freeze.
