     2	
     3	> **Status: OWNER DRAFT, 2026-10-24** (Claude Opus 5.5). At the author's request, this states what Tessera V1
     4	> promises the people who use it and rely on it, from outside. It names no internal component. It does not change
     5	> the registered claim (A9.1, A10) or `docs/V1-CONTRACT.md`, which covers what a receipt establishes; where they
     6	> differ, they win. Clause ids are binding from the first handoff of this contract to anyone who builds from it; from then on they are
     7	> never reused, and a changed clause gets a new id. (They were renumbered once on 2026-10-24, before any handoff.)
     8	> **Undecided** marks a promise V1 has not yet made. Each one is a decision the service owes its users before it
     9	> ships. Revised after Codex review SC-01 to SC-21 (`docs/reviews/service-contract/`).
    10	
