    12	
    13	- **Client:** submits content and receives a receipt.
    14	- **Holder:** keeps a receipt. Often the client, but not always.
    15	- **Adjudicator:** decides whether to rely on a receipt, possibly long after issue, possibly after Tessera is gone.
    16	- **Operator:** runs the service for the domain `wamason.com`.
